# FilsPay — rules for AI assistants. See CLAUDE.md (same content).
# The previous version of this file was deliberately wrong (cents, UTC
# windows, Math.random tokens, "never modify tests"). Do not restore it.
# - Money: integer fils, 1 BD = 1000 fils (ADR-0001). parseBhdToFils / formatBhd.
# - Settlement day: Asia/Bahrain (UTC+3). Use BusinessDateOf for instants.
# - Security tokens and codes: crypto.randomInt / crypto.randomBytes only.
# - A test that asserts a bug is changed with an explaining comment.
# - Read the diff before committing anything an assistant wrote.